    "prompt": "Revenant, a wilderness fallen road warden returned to duty. Adult human warrior with balanced average muscular build, weathered olive-gray skin, stern intact face and short coarse dark hair. Low round iron helmet open at face with a dented nasal guard. Worn dark rust chain shirt, split brown leather skirt, practical steel bracers and thick walking boots. Old moss stitched through the shoulder strap, faded red cloth wraps and pale salt stains. Both hands empty and clearly visible. Undead through stillness and cold gray eyes, not a skeleton or zombie gore. Grounded veteran silhouette, no huge pauldrons, no spikes.",
